;\">풀암</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br></span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uscepters/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">셉터</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uspears/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스피어</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/ustaves/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스태프</span></b></font><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">| </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uswords/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스워드</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던지는 \n                무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> |</span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">완드</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Elite \nUniques</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">: </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021118022344/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Unique Class-Armor,Weapon </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[클래스전용 무기와방호구]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"84\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/maidenpike.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"112\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:56/112\" width=\"56\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Lycander's \nFlank</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Ceremonial Pike</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"215\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(132.5-154) To (305-356)</font> (218.75-255 Avg)<br>Required \nLevel: 42<br>Required Strength: 115<br>Required Dexterity: 98<br>Durability: \n25<br>(Amazon Only)<br>Base Weapon Speed: [20]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% \nEnhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 25-50 \nDamage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Amazon Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% Increased Attack Speed</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">5-9% Life \nStolen Per Hit</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To \nStrength</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To Vitality</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20% Enhanced Defense</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Javelin \nand Spear Skills (Amazon Only)</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손 \n                            데미지 : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(132.5-154) To (305-356)</font> (218.75-255 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : 42<br>힘 요구치 : 115<br>덱스 요구치 : 98<br>내구력 \n                            : \n25<br>(아마존 전용)<br>무기기본속도 : [20]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% \n증가된 데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25-50 \n데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 아마존 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% 공격 속도 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격명중시 5-9% 라이프 획득</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 힘</font></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 바이탈러티</font><